      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.14,
      "end_seconds": 5.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "doctor? Hello, I hope this is the right time"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.75,
      "end_seconds": 13.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.51,
      "end_seconds": 22.32,
      "duration_seconds": 7.81,
      "text": "I've been sweating i wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.27,
      "end_seconds": 26.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.21,
      "end_seconds": 33.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "So So it's been three weeks I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.95,
      "end_seconds": 36.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "how often do you get it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.46,
      "end_seconds": 40.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "It happens a few times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.28,
      "end_seconds": 43.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.43,
      "end_seconds": 48.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Just my septum straightened in my thirties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.66,
      "end_seconds": 53.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.92,
      "end_seconds": 58.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.09,
      "end_seconds": 61.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.08,
      "end_seconds": 68.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.57,
      "end_seconds": 82.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.41,
      "end_seconds": 85.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "no, no conditions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.89,
      "end_seconds": 107.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "let me ask about allergies anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.02,
      "end_seconds": 111.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "not to my knowledge no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.28,
      "end_seconds": 115.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.22,
      "end_seconds": 120.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "no, nothing at the moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.6,
      "end_seconds": 124.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "A few quick ones: seizure or vomiting blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.21,
      "end_seconds": 127.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "none of those, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.49,
      "end_seconds": 130.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "did you notice any seeing things?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.55,
      "end_seconds": 135.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any seeing things."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.79,
      "end_seconds": 139.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.1,
      "end_seconds": 142.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "no, skin's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.46,
      "end_seconds": 148.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.8,
      "end_seconds": 157.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.53,
      "end_seconds": 182.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "okay: pressure 120 over 75, pulse is 104 beats a minute"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.1,
      "end_seconds": 186.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Is that that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.37,
      "end_seconds": 190.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "we'll look at it together shortly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.87,
      "end_seconds": 197.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.45,
      "end_seconds": 200.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.41,
      "end_seconds": 224.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "you have a coarse tremor, a fast pulse and you are sweating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.01,
      "end_seconds": 229.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "please sit back down"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.39,
      "end_seconds": 243.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Okay, thinking it through, this looks most like alcohol withdrawal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.2,
      "end_seconds": 245.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.75,
      "end_seconds": 269.13,
      "duration_seconds": 21.38,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's alcohol withdrawal, and we'll know more once the blood tests is back i'd like to arrange blood tests for alcohol withdrawal i'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.75,
      "end_seconds": 272.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "is that done today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.77,
      "end_seconds": 297.81,
      "duration_seconds": 22.04,
      "text": "we'll begin with thiamine, 100 milligrams, three times a day, long term. That should help with alcohol-related deficiency. Do not stop alcohol suddenly without medical support. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach. We'll catch up in two days. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.48,
      "end_seconds": 301.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "great thank you for your help"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.23,
      "end_seconds": 303.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "all the best"
    }
  ]
